html:
{% if letter_head %}{{ letter_head }}{% endif %}

<style>
  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  body, .invoice-wrap { font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; color: #1a1a1a; background: #fff; }
  @media print { .invoice-wrap { width: 100%; } .no-break { page-break-inside: avoid; } }
  .invoice-wrap { width: 100%; max-width: 780px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .hdr-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; border-bottom: 3px solid #7b2fbf; padding-bottom: 12px; margin-bottom: 14px; }
  .hdr-left { vertical-align: top; width: 50%; }
  .hdr-right { vertical-align: top; text-align: right; width: 50%; }
  .brand-name { font-size: 18pt; font-weight: bold; color: #7b2fbf; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px; }
  .brand-contact { font-size: 9pt; color: #555; margin-top: 4px; line-height: 1.6; }
  .word-invoice { font-size: 24pt; font-weight: bold; color: #f0e6ff; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 3px; background: #7b2fbf; padding: 4px 14px; display: inline-block; }
  .inv-number { font-size: 8.5pt; color: #aaa; margin-top: 5px; }
  .inv-license { font-size: 16pt; color: #7b2fbf; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 3px; }
  .lic-block { margin-top: 6px; line-height: 1.6; }
  .lic-block-title { font-size: 7pt; font-weight: bold; color: #7b2fbf; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px; }
  .lic-category { font-size: 7.5pt; font-weight: bold; color: #1a1a1a; }
  .lic-numbers { font-size: 7.5pt; color: #555; }
  .meta-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; background: #faf5ff; border: 1px solid #e4d4f7; margin-bottom: 16px; }
  .meta-table td { padding: 10px 14px; vertical-align: top; border-right: 1px solid #e4d4f7; }
  .meta-table td:last-child { border-right: none; }
  .meta-label { font-size: 7pt; font-weight: bold; color: #7b2fbf; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px; margin-bottom: 3px; }
  .meta-value { font-size: 10pt; font-weight: bold; color: #1a1a1a; }
  .meta-sub { font-size: 8.5pt; color: #666; margin-top: 1px; }
  .meta-amount { font-size: 13pt; font-weight: bold; color: #7b2fbf; }
  .inv-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-bottom: 12px; font-size: 9.5pt; }
  .inv-table thead tr { background: #7b2fbf; color: #fff; }
  .inv-table thead th { padding: 7px 8px; font-weight: bold; text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 7.5pt; letter-spacing: 0.5px; border: none; }
  .inv-table tbody tr:nth-child(even) { background: #faf5ff; }
  .inv-table tbody tr:nth-child(odd) { background: #fff; }
  .inv-table tbody td { padding: 7px 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eeddf7; vertical-align: middle; }
  .tax-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-bottom: 12px; font-size: 9.5pt; }
  .tax-table thead tr { background: #e4d4f7; color: #4a1a8a; }
  .tax-table thead th { padding: 6px 8px; font-size: 7.5pt; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; font-weight: bold; border: none; }
  .tax-table tbody td { padding: 6px 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eeddf7; }
  .summary-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-bottom: 16px; font-size: 9pt; }
  .summary-table thead tr { background: #f0e6ff; color: #7b2fbf; }
  .summary-table thead th { padding: 5px 8px; font-size: 7.5pt; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; font-weight: bold; border: 1px solid #e4d4f7; }
  .summary-table tbody td { padding: 5px 8px; border: 1px solid #e4d4f7; }
  .footer-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 4px; page-break-inside: avoid; }
  .footer-table td { vertical-align: top; }
  .wire-box { width: 48%; border: 1px solid #e4d4f7; border-left: 4px solid #7b2fbf; background: #faf5ff; padding: 11px 14px; font-size: 9pt; line-height: 2; }
  .wire-title { font-size: 7.5pt; font-weight: bold; color: #7b2fbf; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px; padding-bottom: 5px; border-bottom: 1px solid #e4d4f7; margin-bottom: 6px; }
  .wire-row-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; }
  .wire-row-table td { padding: 1px 0; font-size: 9pt; }
  .wire-lbl { color: #888; font-size: 8.5pt; width: 55%; }
  .wire-val { font-weight: bold; color: #1a1a1a; text-align: right; }
  .totals-cell { width: 4%; }
  .totals-box { width: 48%; text-align: right; }
  .totals-inner { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; }
  .totals-inner td { padding: 5px 4px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f0e6ff; font-size: 10pt; }
  .totals-lbl { color: #555; font-size: 9.5pt; text-align: left; }
  .totals-val { font-weight: bold; color: #1a1a1a; text-align: right; }
  .discount-row td { background: #fef3c7; color: #92400e; font-weight: bold; }
  .outstanding-row td { background: #7b2fbf; color: #fff; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold; padding: 8px 10px; border-bottom: none; }
  .inv-notes { margin-top: 16px; padding: 10px 14px; border: 1px solid #e4d4f7; background: #faf5ff; font-size: 9pt; color: #444; line-height: 1.6; }
  .notes-title { font-size: 7.5pt; font-weight: bold; color: #7b2fbf; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px; margin-bottom: 4px; }
  .terms-wrap { margin-top: 16px; padding: 12px 14px; border: 1px solid #e4d4f7; background: #faf5ff; font-size: 8.5pt; color: #444; line-height: 1.65; }
  .terms-section-title { font-size: 7.5pt; font-weight: bold; color: #7b2fbf; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px; border-bottom: 1px solid #e4d4f7; padding-bottom: 4px; margin-bottom: 7px; margin-top: 12px; }
  .terms-section-title:first-child { margin-top: 0; }
  .terms-wrap p { margin-bottom: 6px; }
  .terms-wrap p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
</style>

<div class="invoice-wrap">

  <table class="hdr-table" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
    <tr>
      <td class="hdr-left">
        <div class="brand-name">MOTLEY TERPZ, LLC</div>
        <div class="brand-contact">California<br>310-780-4784</div>
      </td>
      <td class="hdr-right">
        <div class="word-invoice">Invoice</div>
        <div class="inv-number">{{ _(doc.name) }}</div>
        <div class="inv-license">{{ _(doc.custom_license) }}</div>
        <div class="lic-block">
          <div class="lic-block-title">Licenses</div>
          <div class="lic-category">Extracts:</div>
          <div class="lic-numbers">DCC-10004754, C11-0001548-LIC, C11-0002022, DCC-10003573</div>
          <div class="lic-category">Fresh Frozen:</div>
          <div class="lic-numbers">TSBC — CCL20-0001414</div>
        </div>
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <table class="meta-table" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
    <tr>
      <td style="width:30%;">
        <div class="meta-label">Bill To</div>
        <div class="meta-sub">{{ doc.customer_name }}</div>
        <div class="meta-sub">{{ doc.custom_sales_order_type }}</div>
      </td>
      <td style="width:20%;">
        <div class="meta-label">Invoice Date</div>
        <div class="meta-value">{{ frappe.format_date(doc.transaction_date) }}</div>
      </td>
      <td style="width:20%;">
        <div class="meta-label">Delivery Date</div>
        <div class="meta-value">{{ frappe.format_date(doc.delivery_date) }}</div>
      </td>
      <td style="width:30%; text-align:right;">
        <div class="meta-label">Amount Due</div>
        <div class="meta-amount">{{ frappe.utils.fmt_money(doc.grand_total - doc.advance_paid, currency=doc.currency) }}</div>
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  {% set grouped = {} %}
  {% set normal_items = [] %}
  {% for item in doc.items %}
    {% if item.custom_generalization %}
      {% if item.custom_generalization in grouped %}
        {% set _ = grouped[item.custom_generalization].update({
          "rate": grouped[item.custom_generalization].rate + item.rate,
          "qty": grouped[item.custom_generalization].qty + item.qty,
          "amount": grouped[item.custom_generalization].amount + item.amount,
          "discount_percentage": (item.discount_percentage or 0)
        }) %}
      {% else %}
        {% set _ = grouped.update({ item.custom_generalization: {
          "description": item.custom_generalization,
          "rate": item.rate, "qty": item.qty, "amount": item.amount,
          "uom": item.uom, "type": item.item_group,
          "discount_percentage": (item.discount_percentage or 0)
        }}) %}
      {% endif %}
    {% else %}
      {% set _ = normal_items.append(item) %}
    {% endif %}
  {% endfor %}

  {% set ns = namespace(has_item_disc=false) %}
  {% for key, row in grouped.items() %}
    {% if row.discount_percentage > 0 %}{% set ns.has_item_disc = true %}{% endif %}
  {% endfor %}
  {% for item in normal_items %}
    {% if (item.discount_percentage or 0) > 0 %}{% set ns.has_item_disc = true %}{% endif %}
  {% endfor %}

  <table class="inv-table" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th style="width:5%; text-align:center;">#</th>
        <th style="width:{% if ns.has_item_disc %}33{% else %}38{% endif %}%; text-align:left;">Description</th>
        <th style="width:15%; text-align:center;">Type</th>
        <th style="width:12%; text-align:center;">Qty</th>
        <th style="width:13%; text-align:right;">Rate</th>
        {% if ns.has_item_disc %}<th style="width:10%; text-align:right;">Disc%</th>{% endif %}
        <th style="width:{% if ns.has_item_disc %}12{% else %}17{% endif %}%; text-align:right;">Amount</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      {% for key, row in grouped.items() %}
      <tr>
        <td style="text-align:center; color:#bbb;">{{ loop.index }}</td>
        <td><strong>{{ row.description.split(' - ')[0].split('_')[0].split('-')[0] }}</strong></td>
        <td style="text-align:center; color:#7b2fbf; font-size:8pt;">{{ row.type }}</td>
        <td style="text-align:center;">{{ row.qty }} {{ row.uom }}</td>
        <td style="text-align:right;">{{ frappe.utils.fmt_money(row.rate, currency=doc.currency) }}</td>
        {% if ns.has_item_disc %}<td style="text-align:right; color:#b45309; font-weight:bold;">{% if row.discount_percentage > 0 %}{{ row.discount_percentage }}%{% endif %}</td>{% endif %}
        <td style="text-align:right; font-weight:bold;">{{ frappe.utils.fmt_money(row.amount, currency=doc.currency) }}</td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
      {% for item in normal_items %}
      <tr>
        <td style="text-align:center; color:#bbb;">{{ grouped|length + loop.index }}</td>
        <td><strong>{{ item.item_name.split(' - ')[0].split('_')[0].split('-')[0] }}</strong></td>
        <td style="text-align:center; color:#7b2fbf; font-size:8pt;">{{ item.item_group }}</td>
        <td style="text-align:center;">{{ item.qty }} {{ item.uom }}</td>
        <td style="text-align:right;">{{ frappe.utils.fmt_money(item.rate, currency=doc.currency) }}</td>
        {% if ns.has_item_disc %}<td style="text-align:right; color:#b45309; font-weight:bold;">{% if (item.discount_percentage or 0) > 0 %}{{ item.discount_percentage }}%{% endif %}</td>{% endif %}
        <td style="text-align:right; font-weight:bold;">{{ frappe.utils.fmt_money(item.amount, currency=doc.currency) }}</td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>

  {% if doc.taxes %}
  <table class="tax-table" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th style="width:8%; text-align:center;">#</th>
        <th style="width:48%; text-align:left;">Tax / Charge</th>
        <th style="width:22%; text-align:right;">Amount</th>
        <th style="width:22%; text-align:right;">Running Total</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      {% for tax in doc.taxes %}
      <tr>
        <td style="text-align:center; color:#bbb;">{{ loop.index }}</td>
        <td><strong>{{ tax.description }}</strong></td>
        <td style="text-align:right;">{{ frappe.utils.fmt_money(tax.tax_amount, currency=doc.currency) }}</td>
        <td style="text-align:right; font-weight:bold;">{{ frappe.utils.fmt_money(tax.total, currency=doc.currency) }}</td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>
  {% endif %}

  {% set group_map = {} %}
  {% for item in doc.items %}
    {% set key = item.item_group %}
    {% if key in group_map %}
      {% set _ = group_map.update({ key: { "qty": group_map[key]["qty"] + item.qty, "amount": group_map[key]["amount"] + item.amount, "uom": item.uom }}) %}
    {% else %}
      {% set _ = group_map.update({ key: { "qty": item.qty, "amount": item.amount, "uom": item.uom }}) %}
    {% endif %}
  {% endfor %}

  <table class="summary-table" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th style="text-align:left;">Item Group</th>
        <th style="text-align:center;">Quantity</th>
        <th style="text-align:right;">Amount</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      {% for group, values in group_map.items() %}
      <tr>
        <td>{{ group }}</td>
        <td style="text-align:center;">{{ values.qty }} {{ values.uom }}</td>
        <td style="text-align:right; font-weight:bold;">{{ frappe.utils.fmt_money(values.amount, currency=doc.currency) }}</td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <table class="footer-table no-break" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
    <tr>
      <td class="wire-box">
        <div class="wire-title">Wire / ACH Payment Info</div>
        <table class="wire-row-table" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
          <tr><td class="wire-lbl">Bank Name</td><td class="wire-val">Blue Sky Bank</td></tr>
          <tr><td class="wire-lbl">Account Number</td><td class="wire-val">000020037008</td></tr>
          <tr><td class="wire-lbl">Routing Number</td><td class="wire-val">103101877</td></tr>
        </table>
      </td>
      <td class="totals-cell"></td>
      <td class="totals-box">
        <table class="totals-inner" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
          <tr>
            <td class="totals-lbl">Product QTY</td>
            <td class="totals-val">{{ doc.total_qty }}</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="totals-lbl">Subtotal</td>
            <td class="totals-val">{{ frappe.utils.fmt_money(doc.total, currency=doc.currency) }}</td>
          </tr>
          {% set computed_disc = doc.total - doc.grand_total %}
          {% if computed_disc > 0 %}
          <tr class="discount-row">
            <td class="totals-lbl">Discount</td>
            <td class="totals-val">- {{ frappe.utils.fmt_money(computed_disc, currency=doc.currency) }}</td>
          </tr>
          {% endif %}
          <tr>
            <td class="totals-lbl">Invoice Total</td>
            <td class="totals-val">{{ frappe.utils.fmt_money(doc.grand_total, currency=doc.currency) }}</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="totals-lbl">Amount Paid</td>
            <td class="totals-val">{{ frappe.utils.fmt_money(doc.advance_paid, currency=doc.currency) }}</td>
          </tr>
          <tr class="outstanding-row">
            <td>Outstanding</td>
            <td style="text-align:right;">{{ frappe.utils.fmt_money(doc.grand_total - doc.advance_paid, currency=doc.currency) }}</td>
          </tr>
        </table>
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  {% if doc.custom_terms %}
  <div class="inv-notes no-break">
    <div class="notes-title">Notes</div>
    {{ doc.custom_terms }}
  </div>
  {% endif %}

  <div class="terms-wrap no-break">
    <div class="terms-section-title">Terms &amp; Conditions</div>
    <p>Masters Touch Manufacturing, LLC and LA CANNA DISTRO, LLC is not responsible for any cannabis product that fails state-required testing, regulatory compliance requirements, or quality standards after transfer to Buyer. Buyer is solely responsible for conducting all required due diligence, including but not limited to laboratory testing, quality verification, regulatory review, and suitability of any material for its intended use prior to manufacturing, processing, packaging, distribution, resale, or further transfer.</p>
    <p>By accepting the goods described on this invoice, Buyer acknowledges receipt of the products in their current condition and agrees to pay the invoice amount in full according to the payment terms stated herein.</p>
    <p>Any unpaid balance shall accrue interest at the rate of ten percent (10%) per annum, or the maximum rate permitted by applicable law, whichever is less. In the event Masters Touch Manufacturing, LLC and/or LA CANNA DISTRO, LLC undertake collection efforts to recover amounts due, Buyer agrees to reimburse all reasonable collection costs, including collection agency fees, attorney&#39;s fees, court costs, and other expenses incurred in enforcing payment obligations.</p>
    <div class="terms-section-title">Return Policy</div>
    <p>All sales are final unless otherwise agreed in writing.</p>
    <p>Products may not be returned if packaging, tamper-evident seals, containers, labels, or other security measures have been opened, altered, damaged, or removed.</p>
    <p>Buyer shall inspect all products upon receipt and notify Seller of any shortages, discrepancies, or visible damage within forty-eight (48) hours of delivery. Failure to provide timely notice shall constitute acceptance of the products as delivered.</p>
    <p>Due to cannabis regulatory requirements and product safety concerns, no returns will be accepted for products that have been opened, stored, handled, or transferred after delivery except as required by law or pursuant to an approved recall.</p>
    <div class="terms-section-title">Cannabis Compliance</div>
    <p>Buyer represents that it holds all licenses and approvals required under applicable state and local laws to possess, receive, transport, manufacture, distribute, or sell the products purchased. Buyer assumes all responsibility for compliance with applicable laws and regulations following transfer of custody and control of the products.</p>
  </div>

</div>
